
{{Quote|In the Arena full of uncertainty, Hero Mega Minion wants to make sure he can get to the right place in just the nick of time. Learning to shift through the shadows doesn't happen overnight!}}{{Heroic_Card_Infobox|Cost=3|AbilityCost=2|Rarity=Rare|Type=Troop|Arena=Barbarian Bowl|ReleaseDate=February 2, 2026}}
The Heroic Mega Minion is a {{Rarity|Rare}} [[Cards|card]] that is unlocked with 200 {{Icon|I=Hero Shard}}. It appears as an enlarged [[Minions|Minion]] wearing a set of armor with a mask, chainmail, and a team-colored belt. A Heroic Mega Minion card costs 3 {{Icon|I=Elixir}} to deploy.

== Ability: Wounding Warp ==
{{Quote|Warps to the lowest-Hitpoint enemy, dealing damage on arrival.}}{{Hero Ability|3=Wounding Warp}}
The Hero Mega Minion has a special ability accessible from whatever side of the screen was put in, just above the player's [[Cards|card]] slots in [[Basics of Battle|battle]]. When deployed, a marker will be deployed to the lowest hitpoint target. When that unit dies, the mark will move to the next unit. When the ability is preased, Mega Minion will teleport to that tile, dealing damage. Afterwards the Mega Minion will behave normally, but with -75% on the tower. The Wounding Warp ability costs 2 [[Elixir]] to activate.

== Strategy ==
*Use the ability to snipe ranged units far away, like [[Wizard]] and [[Musketeer]] to teleport and kill them.
*When defending, you can use swarms like [[Skeletons]] to take the agro of the aim. Making it so he cant target the unit he wants.
*Be carefull when you use the ability, as it can be a 2 elixir waist. It could also lead to less crown tower damage overall.

