== History ==
2026

* Hero Mega Minion was released on 2/2/2026 with the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (2/2/2026)|Febuary 2026 Update]], alongside [[Goblins/Hero|Hero Goblins]]{{Balance|Add}}.
* On 2/3/2026, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (2/3/2026)|March 2026 Update]] decreased the Wounding Warp's damage by 12%{{Balance|Nerf}}.
* On 7/4/2026, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (7/4/2026)|Balance Update]], a first target delay of 1.5s was implemented on the Hero Mega Minion, to where it could no longer instantly spawn to targeted troop when ability is activated{{Balance|Add}}.
* On 4/5/2026, a [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (4/5/2026)|Balance Update]], decreased the Hero Mega Minion's warp damage by 9%{{Balance|Nerf}}.
* On 4/8/2026, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/8/2026)|Balance Update]], decreased the Hero Mega Minion's tower multiplier to x0.25 (from x0.5){{Balance|Nerf}}, it's crown tower damage reduction is now permanent{{Balance|Nerf}}, and its warp damage has been increased by 7%{{Balance|Buff}}.

